  "body": "In the description of [`method` and `formmethod`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-control-infrastructure.html#attr-fs-method) attributes:\r\n\r\n> The invalid value default for these attributes is the GET state. The missing value default for the `method` attribute is also the GET state. (There is no missing value default or invalid value default for the `formmethod` attribute.)\r\n\r\nThe prose in the parentheses \"or invalid value default\" seems unnecessary and wrong, because it conflicts with the first sentence in the same paragraph. (Moreover, this invalid value default is also do required for the definition of [method of an element](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-control-infrastructure.html#concept-fs-method) immediately after it.)\r\n",
